title: "pqctoday-tpm: ML-KEM and ML-DSA for the TPM 2.0 Library Specification V1.85"
abstract: >-
  A fork of libtpms and swtpm that adds post-quantum ML-KEM (FIPS 203) and
  ML-DSA (FIPS 204) support following the TPM 2.0 Library Specification
  Version 1.85.
